es and salaries in 2020 was DKK 26,778 million.' The word 'Correct' is in green, and the answer matches the highlighted cell in the evidence table.\n\n**Overall Context**\nThe figure demonstrates how RAG-Anything correctly navigates a financial table to find the intersection of the 'Wages and salaries' row and '2020' column, yielding the correct value of 26,778 million DKK, while baseline models produce incorrect answers (32,928, 11,503, 11,503). This aligns with the case study description in the surrounding text, which explains that RAG-Anything transforms the table into a structured graph with row headers, column headers, data cells, and units as nodes, enabling precise retrieval and disambiguation of similar terms."}
